%N A242011 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=0} (-1)^k*(log(4k+1)/(4k+1)+log(4k+3)/(4k+3)).
%H A242011 Steven R. Finch, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.00578">Errata and Addenda to Mathematical Constants</a>, arXiv:2001.00578 [math.HO], 2020-2024. See section 1.10, p. 9.
%F A242011 Equals (Pi/(2*sqrt(2)))*(log(Gamma(1/8)*Gamma(3/8)/(Gamma(5/8)*Gamma(7/8))) - (gamma + log(2*Pi))), where gamma is Euler's constant and Gamma(x) is the Euler Gamma function. [corrected by _Amiram Eldar_, Nov 14 2026]
%F A242011 Equals Pi*(4*log(Gamma(1/8)) - 2*log(Pi*Gamma(1/4)) - gamma - 5*log(2)/2 - log(1 + sqrt(2))) / 2^(3/2). - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Nov 14 2026
%e A242011 0.02300458786273601031799260214514696231866764147508832909638...
%t A242011 s = (Pi/(2*Sqrt[2]))*(Log[Gamma[1/8]*Gamma[3/8]/(Gamma[5/8]*Gamma[7/8])] - (EulerGamma + Log[2*Pi])); Join[{0}, RealDigits[s, 10, 99] // First]
%o A242011 (PARI) (Pi/(2*sqrt(2)))*(log(gamma(1/8)*gamma(3/8)/(gamma(5/8)*gamma(7/8))) - (Euler + log(2*Pi))) \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Nov 14 2026
